  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 245063d0074fa454484ef1dca8c13a2d, type: 3}
  m_Name: lore_l5_director
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: RootAccess.Systems::RootAccess.Systems.LoreDefinition
  loreId: lore_l5_director
  title: 'Jurnal personal: directorul'
  body: "Cineva umbl\u0103 prin re\u021Bea cu contul root. Eu l-am creat, acum zece
    ani, ca u\u0219\u0103 din spate pentru ziua \xEEn care consiliul m-ar fi dat
    afar\u0103. N-am crezut c\u0103-l va g\u0103si altcineva. Acum el \xEEmi deschide
    u\u0219ile mie."
  titleEn: 'Personal log: the director'
  bodyEn: Someone is walking around the network with the root account. I created
    it ten years ago, as a back door for the day the board would fire me. I never
    thought anyone else would find it. Now it opens my own doors.
  levelId: level05
  order: 13
